OL,3,GNEWSABiker, aged 17, dies in coastal
OL,4,Aroad crash in Aberdeenshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has died in a motorbike
OL,7,Fcrash in Aberdeenshire.
OL,9,FThe collision happened on the B9031
OL,10,Fnear Pennan at about 17:30 on Monday.
OL,12,FPolice said the 17-year-old male rider
OL,13,Fof a black Honda CB500 motorcycle was
OL,14,Fpronounced dead at the scene. No other
OL,15,Fvehicles were involved.
OL,17,FThe road was closed for around six
OL,18,Fhours for accident investigators to
OL,19,Fexamine the scene.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
